#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:2
msgid "vcio interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `vcio` interface permits input and output access to a Raspberry Pi's "
"_VideoCore_ multimedia processor, typically used to improve graphics "
"performance and to accelerate the encoding or decoding of media codecs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"This interface is primarily intended to be used with {ref}`Ubuntu Core <ref-"
"glossary_ubuntu-core>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:9
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:11
msgid "**Auto-connect**: no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:13
msgid ""
"A Raspberry Pi permits its GPU to be programmed from userspace via the `/dev/"
"vcio`  device, access to which this interface enables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:16
msgid "Code examples"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:18
msgid ""
"The Kodi-Raspberry Pi standalone [snap](https://snapcraft.io/kodi-pi-"
"standalone) uses the _vcio_ interface, as configured in its snapcraft.yaml: "
"https://github.com/ogra1/kodi-pi-standalone/blob/master/snap/snapcraft.yaml"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:20
msgid ""
"The test code can be found in the snapd repository: https://github.com/"
"canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/vcio_test.go"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/vcio-interface.md:22
msgid ""
"The source code for the interface is in the snapd repository: https://"
"github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/vcio.go"
msgstr ""
